y do not vary the result.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33%\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2vw\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2vw\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/outside-01.jpg\" alt=\"Słońce przebijające się przez gęsty las.\" /></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.62%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.62%\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/outside-02.jpg\" alt=\"Turbiny wiatrowe stojące na trawiastej równinie, na tle błękitnego nieba.\" /></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"3vw\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"69%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:69%\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/outside-03.jpg\" alt=\"Słońce świeciło nad granią schodzącą do brzegu. W oddali po drodze jedzie samochód.\" /></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:33%\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2vw\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2vw\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#000000\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"17px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#000000;font-size:17px\">Niewątpliwie nie mamy pytań, na które nie ma odpowiedzi. Musimy ufać doskonałości stworzenia tak dalece, aby wierzyć, że jakakolwiek ciekawość porządku rzeczy, wzbudzona w naszych umysłach, porządek rzeczy może ją zaspokoić. Stan każdego człowieka jest rozwiązaniem w hieroglifie na te pytania, które on by postawił.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\";}i:11;O:8:\"stdClass\":7:{s:2:\"id\";i:2209;s:5:\"title\";O:8:\"stdClass\":1:{s:8:\"rendered\";s:34:\"Media i tekst z obrazkiem po lewej\";}s:7:\"content\";O:8:\"stdClass\":2:{s:8:\"rendered\";s:638:\"\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignfull is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-center\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/architecture-04.jpg\" alt=\"Zbliżenie, abstrakcyjny widok na architekturę.\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Otwarte przestrzenie</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-extra-small-font-size\"><a href=\"#\">Zobacz przypadek użycia <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">↗</span></a></p>\n</div></div>\n\";s:9:\"protected\";b:0;}s:4:\"meta\";O:8:\"stdClass\":8:{s:13:\"wpop_keywords\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"wpop_description\";s:70:\"Blok medialno-tekstowy z obrazem po lewej i tekstem po prawej stronie.\";s:19:\"wpop_viewport_width\";i:1200;s:16:\"wpop_block_types\";a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}s:11:\"wpop_locale\";s:5:\"pl_PL\";s:15:\"wpop_wp_version\";s:0:\"\";s:25:\"wpop_contains_block_types\";s:43:\"core/heading,core/media-text,core/paragraph\";s:9:\"footnotes\";s:0:\"\";}s:14:\"category_slugs\";a:1:{i:0;s:6:\"banner\";}s:13:\"keyword_slugs\";a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"core\";i:1;s:8:\"featured\";}s:15:\"pattern_content\";s:871:\"<!-- wp:media-text {\"align\":\"full\",\"mediaType\":\"image\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignfull is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-center\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/architecture-04.jpg\" alt=\"Zbliżenie, abstrakcyjny widok na architekturę.\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#000000\"}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Otwarte przestrzenie</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"extra-small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-extra-small-font-size\"><a href=\"#\">Zobacz przypadek użycia ↗</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\";}i:12;O:8:\"stdClass\":7:{s:2:\"id\";i:2481;s:5:\"title\";O:8:\"stdClass\":1:{s:8:\"rendered\";s:47:\"Duży nagłówek z tekstem wyrównanym do lewej\";}s:7:\"content\";O:8:\"stdClass\":2:{s:8:\"rendered\";s:1402:\"\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull\" style=\"min-height:800px;aspect-ratio:unset;aspect-ratio:unset;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-60 has-background-dim\"></span><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/forest.jpg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" /><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading alignwide has-text-color\" style=\"color:#ffe074;font-size:64px\">Las.</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-13 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:55%\">\n<div style=\"height:330px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#ffe074;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3\"><em>Nawet dziecko wie, jak cenny jest las. Świeży, zapierający dech w piersiach zapach drzew. Echo ptaków latających nad tą gęstą wielkością. Stabilny klimat, zrównoważone, różnorodne życie i źródło kultury. A jednak, lasy i inne ekosystemy wiszą na włosku, zagrożone przekształceniem w pola uprawne, pastwiska i plantacje.</em></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\";s:9:\"protected\";b:0;}s:4:\"meta\";O:8:\"stdClass\":8:{s:13:\"wpop_keywords\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"wpop_description\";s:40:\"Zdjęcie na okładce z cytatem na górze\";s:19:\"wpop_viewport_width\";i:1200;s:16:\"wpop_block_types\";a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}s:11:\"wpop_locale\";s:5:\"pl_PL\";s:15:\"wpop_wp_version\";s:0:\"\";s:25:\"wpop_contains_block_types\";s:75:\"core/column,core/columns,core/cover,core/heading,core/paragraph,core/spacer\";s:9:\"footnotes\";s:0:\"\";}s:14:\"category_slugs\";a:1:{i:0;s:6:\"banner\";}s:13:\"keyword_slugs\";a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"core\";i:1;s:8:\"featured\";}s:15:\"pattern_content\";s:1718:\"<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/forest.jpg\",\"dimRatio\":60,\"minHeight\":800,\"align\":\"full\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull\" style=\"min-height:800px\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-60 has-background-dim\"></span><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/forest.jpg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" /><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#ffe074\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"64px\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading alignwide has-text-color\" style=\"color:#ffe074;font-size:64px\">Las.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns